+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is required on all builds, including development builds, with no environment-specific exception; an earlier workaround that disabled certificate verification in development builds was reviewed and rejected because it created an unacceptable divergence from production behavior, so verification now remains enabled consistently across dev, staging, and production.
